# Buttons

Actions go through `Button` from `@/components/ui`. No decorative icons on the filled commit, no second Signal chip.

The Lectura dock is the exception to Signal: soot fill, paper label — same on-state as selected pills and chat send. Elevation lives on the **bar** (a layered float shadow), not on the button.

```tsx
// BAD
<Button icon={<FlaskConical />}>Leer conjunto</Button>

// GOOD — dock commit
<Button size="sm" className="border-soot bg-soot text-paper">
  Leer conjunto
</Button>
```
